{"speciesId":424,"names":{"fr":"Capidextre","es":"Ambipom","en":"Ambipom","ja":"エテボース"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"To eat, it deftly shucks nuts with its two tails. It rarely uses its arms now."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"They work in large colonies and make rings by linking their tails, apparently in friendship."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, AMBIPOM rarely uses its hands."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"They live on large trees. They are said to communicate by connecting their tails to those of others."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It is very difficult to dodge the consecutive strikes of its two tails."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses queues jumelles sont si agiles et efficaces qu’il ne se sert que très rarement de ses bras."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses queues jumelles sont si agiles et efficaces qu’il ne se sert que très rarement de ses bras."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Split into two, the tails are so adept at handling and doing things, Ambipom rarely uses its hands."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ils vivent en grandes colonies et relient leurs queues pour former un anneau en signe d’amitié."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Habitan en grandes colonias y forman anillos uniendo sus colas, aparentemente en signo de amistad."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They work in large colonies and make rings by linking their tails, apparently in friendship."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"大勢の 群れで 行動する。 尻尾を つなぎ合わせて 輪っかを 作る。友情の 印らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se nourrit de noix qu’il épluche avec ses deux queues habiles. Il utilise de moins en moins ses bras."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Para comer, rompe nueces con sus dos colas. Raras veces utiliza sus brazos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"To eat, it deftly shucks nuts with its two tails. It rarely uses its arms now."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"２本の 尻尾で 木の実の 殻を 器用に むいて 食べる。本物の 腕は ほとんど 使わなくなった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ils vivent en grandes colonies et relient leurs queues pour former un anneau en signe d’amitié."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Habitan en grandes colonias y forman anillos uniendo sus colas, aparentemente en signo de amistad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They work in large colonies and make rings by linking their tails, apparently in friendship."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"大勢の 群れで 行動する。 尻尾を つなぎ合わせて 輪っかを 作る。友情の 印らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il se nourrit de noix qu’il épluche avec ses deux queues habiles. Il utilise de moins en moins ses bras."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Para comer, rompe nueces con sus dos colas. Raras veces utiliza sus brazos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"To eat, it deftly shucks nuts with its two tails. It rarely uses its arms now."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"２本の 尻尾で 木の実の 殻を 器用に むいて 食べる。本物の 腕は ほとんど 使わなくなった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il se dispute constamment les arbres les plus confortables avec Quartermac et remporte la victoire la moitié du temps."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Su especie arma constantes trifulcas por los árboles más cómodos con los Passimian. Suelen ganar la mitad de las veces."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"In their search for comfortable trees, they get into territorial disputes with groups of Passimian. They win about half the time."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"居心地の良い 木を 巡って ナゲツケサルのグループと 縄張りを 争っている。 結果は ５分だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il utilise toujours ses deux queues pour faire la moindre tâche. Il s’en sert aussi pour enlacer les gens qu’il affectionne tout particulièrement."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Utiliza las dos colas para todo. Cuando abraza a alguien con ellas significa que esa persona se ha ganado por completo su confianza."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It uses its tails for everything. If it wraps both of its tails around you and gives you a squeeze, that’s proof it really likes you."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"なにを するにも シッポを 使う。 ２本の シッポで 抱きしめられたら 本当に 懐かれた 証。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"To affirm their kinship, members of this species will form a ring by linking their newly doubled tails together. On rare occasions, humans have been accepted into such rings."}],"varieties":[{"id":424,"moves":[{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"scratch","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns"